first: Server Power Operations, SOL Console, KVM, Virtual Media, then
Reboot BMC, Firmware, Backup and Restore, Tasks, Preserve Configuration,
Factory Default.

Move all Operations children out of the static initializer array into
explicit ordered push() calls so the insertion order is fully controlled.

